<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 160-7 AT LUNCH V SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 160-7 AT LUNCH V SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 160 for seven in their second innings at lunch against South Africa on the fourth day of the third and final cricket test match at Centurion Park on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 227 and 160-7 (Steve Waugh 51 not out), South Africa 384.</p>
